  unitName: Phoenix Reborn
  unitId: 10115
  unitNumber: 370
  description: The highest class of all Phoenixes, they are so close to being immortal
    that few care about growing stronger. However, there are still some who do care.
    These Phoenixes, having evolved into a higher form than other Phoenixes, are
    almost never seen. They seek strength out of their deep attachment to life as
    well as in order to face more powerful foes, leading many to theorize about them
    even today.
  summonDesc: I am a growing light. <br>I illuminate the darkness.<br>Let me burn
    myself unto you.
  fusionDesc: My flames are pure power.<br>It is my place in life to protect<br>you
    and your allies.
  evoDesc: My bright flames carry hope.<br>Let's work together to vanquish<br>the
    darkness of despair.
  element: 1
  rarity: 5
